            </property>
           </widget>
          </item>
          <item>
           <widget class="QLabel" name="about_conversion_label">
            <property name="text">
             <string>Snooz converts two formats of DOMINO files.&lt;br/&gt;• The sleep profile (2 columns, the time and the stage) gives the sleep stages, in the group stage.&lt;br/&gt;• The annotations from the expert (3 columns, the start and end times, the duration and the name) keep their names. Their group is the end of the "Signal ID", for example flow.&lt;br/&gt;The times become seconds from the "Start Time" of the DOMINO file. Snooz skips the other DOMINO files, and the log file gives the reason.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;The documentation of the tool ("Read more!" below) shows examples of DOMINO files, the conversion of each column and the lists of the files converted and skipped.</string>
            </property>
            <property name="textFormat">
             <enum>Qt::TextFormat::RichText</enum>
            </property>
            <property name="wordWrap">
             <bool>true</bool>
            </property>
            <property name="variant" stdset="0">
             <string notr="true">help</string>
            </property>
           </widget>
